    <title>dotnet/machinelearning - Releases - 2026-11-11</title>
    <id>https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning#2026-11-11</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning" />
    <updated>2026-11-12T00:06:12Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/releases/tag/v6.0.0"&gt;ML.NET 6.0.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;Package versions: stable ML.NET packages &lt;strong&gt;6.0.0&lt;/strong&gt;, experimental packages (including DataFrame, AutoML, and TorchSharp) &lt;strong&gt;0.24.0&lt;/strong&gt;, and Tokenizers and its data packages &lt;strong&gt;3.0.0&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support GPT-5.1 model in Tiktoken tokenizer&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7556" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7556/hovercard"&gt;#7556&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support GPT-5.2 in Tokenizer library&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7571" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7571/hovercard"&gt;#7571&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add GPT-5.3 model support to TiktokenTokenizer&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7579" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7579/hovercard"&gt;#7579&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add GPT-5.4 to Tiktoken tokenizer&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7591" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7591/hovercard"&gt;#7591&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add Melt method to DataFrame&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7578" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7578/hovercard"&gt;#7578&lt;/a&gt;) - Thanks &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/sevenzees/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/sevenzees"&gt;@sevenzees&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add GPT-5.5 and GPT-5.6 tokenizer mappings&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7661" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7661/hovercard"&gt;#7661&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add SentencePieceTokenizer factory methods for Unigram from a vocabulary list and tokenizer.json&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7625" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7625/hovercard"&gt;#7625&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add GPT-6 support to TiktokenTokenizer&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7693" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7693/hovercard"&gt;#7693&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable SymbolicSgdLogisticRegression on ARM64&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7671" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7671/hovercard"&gt;#7671&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhancements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add heap-based BPE merge path for pre-tokenized pieces longer than 128 bytes&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7580" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7580/hovercard"&gt;#7580&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remove Google.Protobuf dependency from Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7587" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7587/hovercard"&gt;#7587&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize managed FastTree Sumup on ARM64&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7670" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7670/hovercard"&gt;#7670&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avoid Microsoft.Bcl.Memory on modern .NET targets&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7703" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7703/hovercard"&gt;#7703&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;.NET 8+ applications no longer require &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.Bcl.Memory&lt;/code&gt; through these packages. .NET Standard 2.0 support remains, with the dependency updated to 9.0.14. This change was also included in ML.NET 5.0.1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use Unsafe.As for FloatUtils bit conversions&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7676" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7676/hovercard"&gt;#7676&lt;/a&gt;) - Thanks &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/abhishekdahad-1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/abhishekdahad-1"&gt;@abhishekdahad-1&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix Merge failures with empty DataFrames&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7573" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7573/hovercard"&gt;#7573&lt;/a&gt;) - Thanks &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/sevenzees/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/sevenzees"&gt;@sevenzees&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix memory leaks and stale-model results when hot-swapping PredictionEnginePool&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7626" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7626/hovercard"&gt;#7626&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix SR-CNN missing anomalies when Period &amp;gt; 0&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7610" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7610/hovercard"&gt;#7610&lt;/a&gt;) - Thanks &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/FanBaoMS/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/FanBaoMS"&gt;@FanBaoMS&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix the endless loop in Join and Merge when both suffixes are the same&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7692" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7692/hovercard"&gt;#7692&lt;/a&gt;) - Thanks &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/HuzaifaChaudary/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/HuzaifaChaudary"&gt;@HuzaifaChaudary&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preserve LightGBM validation groups after dataset loading&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7782" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7782/hovercard"&gt;#7782&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deprecation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remove GenAI packages&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7738" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7738/hovercard"&gt;#7738&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Microsoft.ML.GenAI.Core&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.ML.GenAI.LLaMA&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.ML.GenAI.Mistral&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.ML.GenAI.Phi&lt;/code&gt; are not included in this release and have no corresponding 0.24.0 upgrade.&lt;br&gt;
These were experimental packages and are no longer planned for further development, so they are not part of ML.NET 6 and will not receive further updates.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;Microsoft.ML.TorchSharp&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers&lt;/code&gt; remain available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full changelog:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/compare/v5.0.0...6eff5ccedce81728c927bfa0155284aadd38531d"&gt;ML.NET 5.0.0 to the 6.0.0 release build&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
